# Omarchy migrations that must never run here. The user unit marks each one
# complete for every account, so omarchy-migrate stops offering it.
#
# Every migration runs unless it cannot run without a risk of bricking this
# ZFS host (ADR 0005). Each row says which risk.

# Installs linux-omarchy and its headers. The root pool's ZFS module comes
# from linux-cachyos-zfs; this kernel would rely on zfs-dkms building one, and
# ZFSBootMenu may pick it as the newest kernel.
1789325478.sh

# Moves [omarchy] above every other repository and runs a full upgrade.
# [omarchy] carries quickshell, nvidia dkms builds, kernels and the real
# limine packages, which would then win over CachyOS and the boot stub.
1791403252.sh
